WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.692
Ricky: ROAR! I'm Bigfoot!

2
00:00:14.693 --> 00:00:19.625
Rachel: Ahh! Mom!

3
00:00:19.626 --> 00:00:23.970
Mom: Ricky, don't scare your sister.

4
00:00:23.971 --> 00:00:28.578
Rachel: Dad, is Bigfoot real?

5
00:00:28.579 --> 00:00:34.265
Dad: I don't think so. It's a fairy tale.

6
00:00:34.266 --> 00:00:38.973
Ricky: It is real! I'm going to catch it.

7
00:00:38.974 --> 00:00:42.498
Dad: Okay, but be careful.

8
00:00:42.499 --> 00:00:53.200
Ricky: I'm not scared. I am brave and strong.

9
00:00:53.201 --> 00:00:55.679
Mom: It's time for

10
00:00:55.680 --> 00:01:00.870
bed. Ricky: Can I stay up? I want to see the

11
00:01:00.871 --> 00:01:17.493
fireflies. Mom: Okay, Ricky. Rachel, go to bed

12
00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:23.014
now. Ricky: W-w-who's

13
00:01:23.015 --> 00:01:30.684
t-t-there? D-d-dad? B-b-bigf-f-foot?

14
00:01:30.685 --> 00:01:45.547
Ricky: Ahh! Help me! Dad, Mom, Rachel, please help me!

15
00:01:45.548 --> 00:01:50.538
Ricky: Dad! Rachel!

16
00:01:50.539 --> 00:01:57.140
Dad: Sorry, Ricky. It was Rachel's turn to scare you.

17
00:01:57.141 --> 00:02:00.074
Ricky: I'm sorry, Rachel.

18
00:02:00.075 --> 00:02:04.303
All: Ha-ha-ha!

